BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Saving damage</h1>
Delta-gliders lose parts (one landed: its wing tip comes to rest beside
it; one in orbit: its nose drifts away; one spun up in orbit breaks up),
and the scenario is saved (the damage model on: the test sets
ORBITER_DAMAGE=1). The
test Scenario.DamageLoadTest loads it again and checks that the vessels'
lost parts and the debris are as they were.
END_HYPERDESC

